lass="leg-linenum">15</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">federal fund (652-00-3230)    No limit</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">16</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:calc(0.1799in + -0.1799in)">Elementary and secondary school aid –</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">17</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">federal fund (652-00-3233)    No limit</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">18</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:calc(0.1799in + -0.1799in)">Education of handicapped children</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">19</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">fund – federal (652-00-3234)    No limit</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">20</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:calc(0.1799in + -0.1799in)">Community-based</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">21</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">child abuse prevention –</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">22</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">federal fund (652-00-3319)    No limit</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">23</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:calc(0.1799in + -0.1799in)">TANF children&#x27;s programs –</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">24</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">federal fund (652-00-3323)    No limit</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">25</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:calc(0.1799in + -0.1799in)">21st century community learning centers –</span></div><div class="leg-line"><span class="leg-linenum">26</span><span class="leg-linecontent" style="padding-left:0.1799in">federal fund (652-0